From 4f610c932fdff752722313ecc06ba7d0c38de8f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 02:47:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] hunt(abl-tri1px): setup-vs-fill ladder, runtime-gated, all 4
 asm kernels kept

HUNTABL_LEVEL=0/1/2 on a global the .S files load, so one binary carries
every rung and TORIDRAW_PROBE_CFLAGS stays empty (the makefile asm gate
never fires).

